          "text": "Two CPSC recalls to check: CooCooBaby Baby Loungers (2,355 units, suffocation + fall risk) and Uuoeebb Infant Walkers on Amazon (fall + entrapment risk). Stop use now. Full refunds available. Details at cpsc.gov.\n\n#COSParenting #ColoradoSprings #COSKids #PikesPeakParenting",
